// corpus operation(s) that exercise it: the card whose page or view render
// reaches the registration, and the actors the op runs as. The ops generator
// (generate-ops.mjs) asserts that every census view is either mapped here or
// listed in UNREACHABLE with a reason, so the corpus's "every view kind"
// guarantee is enforced at generation time, not hoped for.
